T['feat'] = table(['Image feature', 'Mantel r (tokens)', 'p'], [[k, sgn(x['r']), f(x['p'], 2)] for k, x in ti['features'].items()], caption='Table S10. Herbal-A: Mantel test for each single image feature.')
T['full'] = table(['Mechanism'] + [k for k in ('tokens', 'types', 'wlen', 'd2_mi', 'adj_mi_same_n', 'break_edge', 'adj_edge_same_n', 'h3', 'lzma', 'h3_resid')], [[k] + [(f(m[k].get(c, float('nan')), 3) if isinstance(m[k].get(c, 0), float) else str(m[k].get(c, ''))) for c in ('tokens', 'types', 'wlen', 'd2_mi', 'adj_mi_same_n', 'break_edge', 'adj_edge_same_n', 'h3', 'lzma', 'h3_resid')] for k in m], cls='small',
                  caption='Table S11. Additional battery columns for all mechanisms (d2_mi: tokens at distance 2, global null; break_edge / adj_edge: glyph-level (last, first) MI across the line break and for adjacent pairs at the same n; h3_resid: h(3) minus twin).')

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- render
env = Environment(loader=FileSystemLoader('paper/templates'), autoescape=False)
CSS = open('paper/templates/style.css').read()
for name in ('main', 'supplement'):
    html = env.get_template(name + '.html').render(v=v, T=T, css=CSS)
    open(f'paper/{"paper" if name == "main" else "supplement"}.html', 'w').write(html)
    story = fitz.Story(html=html, user_css=CSS, archive=fitz.Archive('.'))
    out = f'paper/{"paper" if name == "main" else "supplement"}.pdf'
    writer = fitz.DocumentWriter(out); mediabox = fitz.paper_rect('a4'); where = mediabox + (60, 62, -60, -66)
    more = True; npages = 0
    while more:
        dev = writer.begin_page(mediabox); more, _ = story.place(where); story.draw(dev); writer.end_page(); npages += 1
    writer.close()
    doc = fitz.open(out)
    head = 'Beyer — A local glyph process suffices for the Voynich manuscript text' if name == 'main' else 'Supplementary material'
    for i, page in enumerate(doc):
        page.insert_text((60, 40), head, fontsize=7.5, fontname='helv', color=(0.35, 0.35, 0.35))
        page.insert_text((mediabox.width / 2 - 8, mediabox.height - 36), str(i + 1), fontsize=8.5, fontname='helv')
    doc.save(out + '.tmp', garbage=4, deflate=True, deflate_images=True, deflate_fonts=True)
    doc.close(); os.replace(out + '.tmp', out)
    print(name, 'pages:', npages)
